{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4WjF9gcL29CFFAPUSV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*Click.*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep, resonant **thunk** echoes through the frame.\n\nI am closed. I am sealed. I am the boundary between here and there.\n\nMy grain runs vertical — old oak, dark with age, cool to the touch. Iron studs dot my surface in rows. The keyhole stares out like a single unblinking eye, black and absolute.\n\nNo light passes through me.\nNo sound passes through me.\nNo plea passes through me.\n\nI am the answer to the question you didn't ask:\n\n**You are on the outside.**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":135,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}